   "summary": "Jinja2 sandbox escape via string formatting",
   "description": "In Pallets Jinja before 2.10.1, `str.format_map` allows a sandbox escape.\n\nThe sandbox is used to restrict what code can be evaluated when rendering untrusted, user-provided templates. Due to the way string formatting works in Python, the `str.format_map` method could be used to escape the sandbox.\n",
   "type": "reviewed",
   "severity": "high",
